    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n46722" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">sŭperfūsĭo</span></b> ,
			ōnis, f.
		superfundo, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>a pouring</i> or <i>spreading
			over</i> or <i>upon</i> (late Lat.): 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">aquarum caelestium,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Amm. 17, 7, 12</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">pavimenti,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Pall. 1, 17, 1</span></i>
			.—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>II.</b>
			<i>An overflowing</i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">haec, Ambros. Hexaëm. 3, 3, 14:
					aquarum,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">id. ib. 3, 2, 7</span></i>
			.</div>
